1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,000
This self-owned synthetic app saves the draft title after Cancel.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The recorded Meta input combines video, uniform frames, pointer pixels and OCR.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Model intent proposes actions. A separate predeclared oracle checks the result.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Recorded CUA step 1: select the task.

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Recorded CUA step 2: open Rename.

6
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Recorded CUA step 3: choose Today.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Recorded CUA step 4: press Cancel.

8
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:15,000
The title is Today after Cancel. The control pair is still required.

9
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:27,000
The independent persisted-state and event oracle reports the faulty signal.

10
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Sampled-context consistency is not physical-tap proof. The optional read-only branch was unused.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Export four semantic steps once. Replay the exact same export on fresh faulty and fixed builds.

12
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Faulty model-free replay: select task.

13
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Faulty model-free replay: open rename.

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Faulty model-free replay: choose today.

15
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Faulty model-free replay: cancel.

16
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Fixed model-free replay: select task.

17
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Fixed model-free replay: open rename.

18
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Fixed model-free replay: choose today.

19
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Fixed model-free replay: cancel.

20
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:38,000
The developer-supplied fixed control keeps Release. Faulty is true; fixed is false.

21
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Original pilot: two of five, below target. Separate FINAL: three of three correlated variants.

22
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Each FINAL case used five model calls and two model-free controls. Upload fees remain unpriced.

23
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Private prototype. Not release approved. Generalization has not been evaluated.
